{
  "id": "E224",
  "title": "Speak of the Devil",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-06-03",
  "synopsis": "Feifei is going to watch a movie together with Little Le and Lili.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/747/00861925f8f4ce189a2eb52cf1d381b40ea99b1f.mp3?1527079143",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "说曹操曹操到\n\n小乐：我们约好了一起看电影的，飞飞怎么还没到啊？\n丽丽：今天是周五，交通不太好，她有可能还堵在路上呢。\n小乐：哎，飞飞总是这么慢……\n丽丽：反正电影还有10分钟才开始呢，别着急。\n飞飞：我到啦！今天我没有迟到，你们是不是得夸夸我啊！\n小乐：真是说曹操曹操到啊，我们正说你呢，你就来了！",
    "traditional": "說曹操曹操到\n\n小樂：我們約好了一起看電影的，飛飛怎麼還沒到啊？\n麗麗：今天是週五，交通不太好，她有可能還堵在路上呢。\n小樂：哎，飛飛總是這麼慢……\n麗麗：反正電影還有10分鐘才開始呢，別著急。\n飛飛：我到啦！今天我沒有遲到，你們是不是得誇誇我啊！\n小樂：真是說曹操曹操到啊，我們正說你呢，你就來了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Speak of the devil and the devil will appear"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：我们约好了一起看电影的，飞飞怎么还没到啊？",
      "traditional": "小樂：我們約好了一起看電影的，飛飛怎麼還沒到啊？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ men yuē hǎo le yì qǐ kàn diàn yǐng de fēi fēi zěn me hái méi dào a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: We decided to watch the movie together, why hasn’t Feifei arrived yet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：今天是周五，交通不太好，她有可能还堵在路上呢。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：今天是週五，交通不太好，她有可能還堵在路上呢。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì jīn tiān shì zhōu wǔ jiāo tōng bú tài hǎo tā yǒu kě néng hái dǔ zài lù shang ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: It’s Friday, the traffic’s not very good. She might be stuck on the road."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：哎，飞飞总是这么慢……",
      "traditional": "小樂：哎，飛飛總是這麼慢……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè āi fēi fēi zǒng shì zhè me màn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Sigh… Feifei is always so slow…"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：反正电影还有10分钟才开始呢，别着急。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：反正電影還有10分鐘才開始呢，別著急。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì fǎn zhèng diàn yǐng hái yǒu 1 fēn zhōng cái kāi shǐ ne bié zháo jí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: The movie doesn’t start for another 10 minutes. Don’t worry."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "飞飞：我到啦！今天我没有迟到，你们是不是得夸夸我啊！",
      "traditional": "飛飛：我到啦！今天我沒有遲到，你們是不是得誇誇我啊！",
      "pinyin": "fēi fēi wǒ dào la jīn tiān wǒ méi yǒu chí dào nǐ men shì bú shì děi kuā kuā wǒ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Feifei: I’m here! I’m not late today. You guys should praise me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：真是说曹操曹操到啊，我们正说你呢，你就来了！",
      "traditional": "小樂：真是說曹操曹操到啊，我們正說你呢，你就來了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhēn shì shuō cáo cāo cáo cāo dào a wǒ men zhèng shuō nǐ ne nǐ jiù lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Speak of the devil and the devil will appear. We were just talking about you, and then you arrived!"
    }
  ],
